Compiler cl

Assembly SDL2main
Extension lib

SourceDirectory src/main/windows
IntermediateDirectory int/sdl2main
if debug BuildDirectory bin/debug
if !debug BuildDirectory bin/release

Compiler.Flags /W3 /GS- /GF
if debug Compiler.Flags /Od /MDd /Z7
if !debug Compiler.Flags /O2 /MD

Compiler.Includes include

Compiler.Defines WIN32 _WINDOWS

if debug Compiler.Defines _DEBUG
if !debug Compiler.Defines NDEBUG
